# Indomitable Spirit (outlands 201), the quest's own var at the completion: accepted, IndomitableSpiritTimer 1 (past)
# and Quest[5][201]Prog 1 (GMs). Irmilant (the second talk of a pair: his default 76 first): 134; finished:
# npcUtil.completeQuest (the Ebisu Fishing Rod, the Indomitable Fisher title, the timer 0, completed), then
# San d'Oria and Bastok fame +10. npcUtil.completeQuest does no cleanup: Quest[5][201]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's
# cleanup would clear it).
char zone=Rabao pos=3.78,9.54,56.21
quest Outlands.IndomitableSpirit accepted
charvar IndomitableSpiritTimer 1
charvar Quest[5][201]Prog 1     # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger Irmilant                # default turn: 76
finish                          # nothing
trigger Irmilant                # script, the timer past: 134
finish-if-event                 # the rod; the title; the timer 0; completed, Prog kept; fame
